### ============================================
### AGENTES - GestionInmobiliaria
### ============================================
### Solo Admin puede crear, actualizar y dar de baja agentes

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5005
@tenant = demo
@token = TU_TOKEN_AQUI

### 1. Obtener todos (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes?pagina=1&tamano=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Buscar por nombre/zona
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes?buscar=dario
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Solo activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes?activo=true
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Lista para combo/dropdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes/activos
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Obtener agente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. Crear agente (solo Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "agente1@inmobiliaria.com",
  "password": "Agente123!",
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellido": "Méndez",
  "zona": "Palermo / Belgrano",
  "telefonoInterno": "int. 101",
  "comisionPorcentaje": 3.5,
  "notas": "Especialista en propiedades premium"
}

###

### 7. Actualizar agente (solo Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellido": "Méndez",
  "zona": "Palermo / Recoleta",
  "telefonoInterno": "int. 101",
  "comisionPorcentaje": 4.0,
  "notas": "Actualizado",
  "activo": true
}

###

### 8. Dar de baja agente (solo Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/agentes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
